# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/cpu_vs_cpu.lua from power-on with nobody at the
# controls. cvc_probe.lua logs the game in play without players and the end of the game.
# - the script starts a game from attract mode, the computer plays all four players, the game
#   runs through four quarters (or overtime) to its end-of-game screen and back to attract
#   mode with PSTATUS 0, on all five games;
# - "Play another" starts the next game, "Back to attract" does not.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/cpu_vs_cpu.lua
extra cvc_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbahangt nbamht
frames 55001
run again=1
run again=0
nolog error
once cpu vs cpu: game 1 started
log in play with no player for 1000 frames
once end of game after period 4 or later
log attract, PSTATUS 0
again=1: once cpu vs cpu: game 2 started
again=0: nolog cpu vs cpu: game 2 started
nolog end of game in period
